    GALLERY

    ╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
    │                                                   │
    │  Palette                                          │
    │                                                   │
    │  Palette (x) neutral  ( ) indigo  ( ) rose        │
    │                                                   │
    │  The theme redefines its tokens in place:         │
    │  switch, and the click count below keeps its      │
    │  value.                                           │
    │                                                   │
    ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

    ╭───────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
    │                                                   │
    │  Text                                             │
    │                                                   │
    │  A run of text with a color and a bold flag.      │
    │                                                   │
    │  Long runs wrap at the available width, breaking  │
    │  at spaces, so a paragraph reads naturally in     │
    │  however many columns it gets.                    │
    │                                                   │
    │  This paragraph opts into selection: drag to      │
    │  select—double-click a word, triple-click a run—  │
    │  and right-click to copy it as it appears in the  │
    │  source.                                          │
    │                                                   │
    │  Rich text mixes weights, colors, and links in    │
    │  one paragraph.                                   │
    │                                                   │
    ╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

